      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Since 1985, Castleberry Hill has been a federally recognized historic district, gaining City of Atlanta Landmark status in 2006.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Castleberry_Hill",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "By the early 1990s, the area fell into heavy decline, even serving as a backdrop for dystopian films like Freejack and Kalifornia.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
